{"id":"reference/noreturn","kind":"langref","title":"noreturn","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#noreturn","file":"reference/noreturn.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"noreturn","text":"noreturn"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"noreturn\" class=\"chapter-anchor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/en/reference/noreturn/#noreturn\">noreturn</a> </h2>\n\n      <p>\n      <code><span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span></code> is the type of:\n      </p>\n      <ul>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">break</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">continue</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code></li>\n          <li><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">while</span> (<span class=\"tok-null\">true</span>) {}</code></li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>When resolving types together, such as <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span></code> clauses or <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">switch</span></code> prongs,\n              the <code><span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span></code> type is compatible with every other type. Consider:\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_noreturn.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">condition</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">bool</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">u32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">condition</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">_</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@panic</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"do something with a\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"noreturn\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">foo</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">false</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_noreturn.zig</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1/1 test_noreturn.test.noreturn...OK</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">All 1 tests passed.</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      <p>Another use case for <code><span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span></code> is the <code>exit</code> function:</p>\n      <div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">test_noreturn_from_exit.zig</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"zig\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">@import</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"std\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">std</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">testing</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">extern</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"kernel32\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">ExitProcess</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">exit_code</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">c_uint</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">callconv</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(.</span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">winapi</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">noreturn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">test</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#032F62;--1:#9ECBFF\">\"foo\"</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">bar</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">ExitProcess</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">try</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">expectEqual</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1234</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"--0:#AE4B07;--1:#FFAB70\">value</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">);</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">fn</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#6F42C1;--1:#B392F0\">bar</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">anyerror!u32</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span class=\"indent\">    </span><span style=\"--0:#BF3441;--1:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\"> </span><span style=\"--0:#005CC5;--1:#79B8FF\">1234</span><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">;</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">}</span></div></div></code></pre></figure></div><div class=\"expressive-code\"><figure class=\"frame is-terminal has-title\"><figcaption class=\"header\"><span class=\"title\">Terminal</span></figcaption><pre data-language=\"shellsession\" data-code-frame=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><div class=\"ec-line\"><div class=\"code\"><span style=\"--0:#24292E;--1:#E1E4E8\">$ zig test test_noreturn_from_exit.zig -target x86_64-windows --test-no-exec</span></div></div>\n</code></pre></figure></div>\n\n      \n\n      "}
